{
 "id": "lem-coef-joyal-homset-iso-detection",
 "kind": "statement",
 "title": "Yoneda detection of an isomorphism by bijective Hom maps",
 "statement": "In any category $\\mathcal C$ as defined in [def-nagata-category], if $t:Y\\to Z$ is a morphism such that for every object $X$ the function $\\operatorname{Hom}_{\\mathcal C}(X,Y)\\to\\operatorname{Hom}_{\\mathcal C}(X,Z)$, $f\\mapsto t\\circ f$, is bijective, then $t$ is an isomorphism.",
 "source": {
  "document": "https://www.math.ias.edu/~lurie/papers/HTT.pdf",
  "place": "Yoneda isomorphism criterion used in the explicit expansion of the proof of Proposition 1.2.7.3, printed p.94; exact Mathlib source CategoryTheory/Yoneda.lean, lines 897-905."
 },
